## Environment variables

The app uses a small set of variables today:

| Variable | Needed | Notes |
| :--- | :---: | :--- |
| `DATABASE_URL` | Yes | PostgreSQL connection string |
| `NEXTAUTH_SECRET` | Yes in production | Session secret |
| `NEXTAUTH_URL` | Yes | App origin |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` | Yes | Public origin used for links/redirects |
| `DEALMEMORY_API_KEY` | For SDK-host flow | Optional for self-hosted console use; used by SDK customers |
| `SDK_CORS_ORIGINS` | Optional | Origins allowed to stream events from browsers |
| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Optional | AI copilot |
| `DODO_*` | Optional | Billing |
| `SUPERMEMORY_*` | Optional | External memory/vector integration |

If you only want the simplest hosted console experience, the first four are the ones that matter most for the app to run.

