## Troubleshooting

- **`NEXTAUTH_SECRET is required in production`** — set a real secret before deploying.
- **`Can't reach database server`** — Postgres is stopped, unreachable, or the connection string is wrong.
- **CORS errors on `/api/v1/events/batch`** — add the client origin to `SDK_CORS_ORIGINS`.
